## Paste Events

Handle pasted text:

### Core

```typescript
renderer.keyInput.on("paste", (text: string) => {
  console.log("Pasted:", text)
})
```

### Solid

Solid provides a dedicated `usePaste` hook:

```tsx
import { usePaste } from "@opentui/solid"

function App() {
  usePaste((event) => {
