## Rendering

### render(node, rendererOrConfig?)

Renders a Solid component tree into a CLI renderer.

```tsx
import { render } from "@opentui/solid"

// Simple usage - creates renderer automatically
render(() => <App />)

// With config
render(() => <App />, {
  exitOnCtrlC: false,
